# Procedures are CONTENT, not runtime. An operator's ASOPs describe their
# companies, their rituals and their incidents, so they live in that operator's
# own private repo — never here. Generic example procedures may ship with the
# runtime one day; when they do they will be written for that purpose, not
# lifted from somebody's deployment.
procedures/
